# Paths kept OUT of git and stored in s3://regattaview-repo-data/tree/<path>
# (private, versioned). Sync with `Scripts/repo_data.py pull|push|status`.
# A trailing "/" means a whole directory; any `scripts/` subdirectory inside
# stays in git (code). Keep .gitignore's "repo data" block in lockstep.

